          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પ્રવાસ (pravās) is Sanskrit pravāsa, \"a stay away from home, a journey\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama. CDIAL has no entry for it."
            }
          ]
        },
