          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વળાવવું — vaḷāvvũ — \"to see off\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મારી બહેને મને સ્ટેશન પર વળાવ્યો. — mārī bahene mane sṭeśan par vaḷāvyo — \"My sister saw me off at the station.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વળવું is to turn; વળાવવું (vaḷāvvũ) is to see someone off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વળાવવું (vaḷāvvũ) is built on vaḷvũ, \"to turn\", with the causative ending -āvvũ: to send someone on his way. vaḷvũ is a tadbhava from Sanskrit válati, \"turns\" (CDIAL 11405)."
            }
          ]
        },
